WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.030
"Pas de Deux of Fantasy and Innocence"

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:41.530
My son.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.740
I am here.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:46.460
Why have you taken so long?

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.000
I apologize.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.920
I asked you why.

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.800
Well...

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.720
Have you forgotten a devil's pride
in that human world?

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:59.260
No, that's not--

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.140
You will atone for betrayal with death.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.930
--I swear to you my unwavering fealty!

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.310
--Silence!
--I swear to you my unwavering fealty!

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:15.860
Words serve no purpose!
I have but one desire: the forbidden grimoire!

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:22.330
If you wish to carry on the Arlond name,
make the grimoire yours!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:35.250
It's times like this I'm positively
thrilled I'm not the Arlond heir.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.090
His old man's fuse is
shorter than most, all right.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:42.140
Rem can stand to be shamed now and again.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:48.940
When I think of how contorted his cool,
princely face must be... ooh!

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:50.400
Butt out, fallen angel.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:51.310
Ow!

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:54.070
It's not like you and Urie
aren't enjoying this, too!

00:02:54.070 --> 00:02:57.190
Even if we are, we don't need <i>you</i> telling us.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.190
Ow!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.200
You love it.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.740
Dramatic much?

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.580
As if you're not both trying
to get one over on Rem

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.410
the first chance you get!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:14.500
You know, the old man <i>is</i>
keeping Rem occupied right now...

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.090
The butterfly is mine.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:22.300
Idiot! She's mine. And so is the grimoire.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:24.600
Shiki!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.140
Dammit! He got the jump on us!

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:06.930
"Home Improvement"

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:11.480
Two cans of spray paint...

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:12.640
Is that everything?

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:15.230
Still need duct tape, and--oh!

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.440
It's on that shelf there!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.860
You just promised not to go off on your own.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.820
That far won't hurt.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.570
Don't be overconfident, now.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:29.330
You never know where they'll show up.
They're like cockroaches.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.660
It's like there are two Lindos.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.420
But can we two girls even carry all this back?

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:42.670
Honestly, the boys in our class don't
lift a finger for the culture festival.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.930
Preparations begin tomorrow, right?
Should we have this stuff shipped?

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:50.350
Yeah, let's. I'll finish
checking out; you wait here.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:53.850
No matter what, stay here.
No matter what. Got it?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.390
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:06.280
Huh? It's that doggie--Rem's, right?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.490
But what's it doing here?

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:18.920
"Special! ¥100 and up!"

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.670
"Big Bargains"

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:27.180
"Delivery Counter"

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:26.010
I'm popping out for a sec! Just a sec, I swear!

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:30.680
"Entrance"

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.990
There you are!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:52.290
Says here... yep,
you're Rem's Loewen, all right.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:56.500
Did you come here all by yourself?
Almost got lost there.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.330
Well, <i>you're</i> in a good mood!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.460
What cute paw-pads!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.800
C'mon, let's head back.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.010
Hey, that tickles!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.730
Oh?

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:22.230
This is the second time you've seen me
in my human form, correct?

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:25.150
I am Loewen.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:39.580
Don't you want to know more
about the forbidden grimoire?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.340
Are you a devil, too?

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:48.420
I am Cerberus. Perhaps it's easiest
to think of me as Hell's watchdog.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:53.100
I am the one who serves at the
right hand of the fiend Maksis.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.310
If you care to know the truth, come with me.

00:06:56.310 --> 00:07:01.900
I will not force you. It's up to you to decide.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:12.030
Azuna? Sorry, I remembered
something I had to do.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:15.200
I'll go home after. I'll be fine.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.870
You naughty girl,

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.710
lying to your friend.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.130
"Call Ended"
"Ritsuka"
"Hold" "End"

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:30.470
It's you!

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:31.470
Shh.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:36.720
Hey, Shiki! A fallen angel like you
has a lotta nerve leaving us behind

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:39.640
and trying to get the jump on us!

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:54.160
Is that how badly you want
the caress of my thorny whip?

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:02.920
Y-You misunderstand!
I was only trying to help you two!

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.960
This girl will know where Ritsuka is!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:06.750
Oh, yeah?

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:07.550
Is that so?

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:08.840
Right?

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:37.530
So what <i>is</i> this forbidden grimoire?
They say it's a book of magic...

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:41.950
So is it full of magic spells? Or--

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.000
Magic spells?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.540
Well, I mean...

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:57.090
Let's hurry. This way.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.560
Tell me here, now!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.810
That's the deal. If you don't plan
on telling me, I won't go with you.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.480
That stubbornness. That courage!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:14.070
Indeed, you are your father's daughter.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.780
The fiend Maksis finds his power failing.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:22.450
You know this as the war between
the devils and vampires, correct?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:29.130
The grimoire is needed
to restore this weakened power.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:35.880
So... the grimoire contains
the method for reviving devils?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:42.520
No. Listen: the grimoire itself
<i>is</i> the great power

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:46.770
that allows whoever holds it
to control the world.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:51.320
Ah, what a lovely fragrance.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:54.360
Fragrance? What is?

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.570
Enough to make even me lose all reason.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.200
Where are you?

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:06.620
Ah... the sweet scent of seduction.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.750
No!

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.550
Stay back!

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:24.680
Those burning eyes--marvelous.
But your charm, more than anything,

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:29.020
is in that scent of the grimoire.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:30.940
Ritsuka Tachibana.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:34.940
The power of the grimoire slumbers within you.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:40.950
You <i>are</i> the forbidden grimoire.
And this scent is proof.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.070
In other words,

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:47.250
whoever has you can open
the gates of Gehenna--that is, Hell--

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.710
and rule this world.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:56.800
I can take the power of the
grimoire out from within you.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:01.680
If I deliver it to my master,
the fiend Maksis...

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:05.510
the war between the devils
and vampires will be concluded,

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:10.060
your mother will return safely,
and no one will come after

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.270
the Tachibana family ever again.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.440
Is that true?!

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:30.920
♪ The forbidden grimoire,
the one and only truth ♪

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:47.970
♪ A servant who gives all to the exalted Name ♪

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:54.690
♪ My allegiance lies in
fulfilling my master's desires ♪

00:11:54.690 --> 00:12:01.240
♪ Should my canine body be burned to ashes ♪

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:09.660
♪ It would be the highest honor
to embrace rapture in my destruction ♪

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:16.130
♪ Come, we'll open it together
this time for sure ♪

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.880
♪ The door that leads to Lord Maksis ♪

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:24.010
♪ An unknown world awaits you ♪

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.640
♪ You hold the key in your hand ♪

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:35.230
♪ Should you wish to return
to more innocent days ♪

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:43.820
♪ Trust in Cerberus and devote yourself to me ♪

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:48.450
Lord Maksis is my all.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:52.660
If he can but obtain the grimoire,
neither you nor the Tachibana clan

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.960
will be of any interest.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:06.260
--Quit foolin' around!

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.260
--Stay back!
--Quit foolin' around!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.930
But that's the last of your holy water, right?

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.600
Where's Ritsuka? Tell us. Or else.

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.940
Devils are nothin' to be trifled with.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.070
Azuna!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.650
Hmph. Here comes trouble.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:26.990
Wouldn't want to raise too much
of a ruckus outside school.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.320
We'll just blame it all on you.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.160
Not cool.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.170
Th-Thank goodness...

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:37.170
Azuna!

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:42.300
Are you all right? You were late
coming back--good thing I came to get you.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.210
Where's Ritsuka?

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:47.510
Huh? Isn't she already home?

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.730
I can't believe that.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:56.770
Believe it or don't,

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.850
but the time is almost upon us.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.110
What time?

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:05.400
The forbidden grimoire
will activate on your 17th birthday

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:08.820
and last until the night of the next full moon.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:16.000
We were going to tell you everything
the day before your 17th birthday.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:17.920
So that's why my brother...

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:21.380
Ah. I see.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:25.010
So your family and your brother already knew

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:28.430
the secret of the grimoire.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.010
Your brother is a very good liar.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:34.770
No! He would never lie to me!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:39.650
He didn't lie, per se.
He merely kept everything quiet--

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:47.780
about the fragrant grimoire in your life
that you protect and nurture.

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:52.660
No need to be afraid.
That power is all I desire.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:59.670
Sleep here in this room,
until your 17th birthday.

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:05.800
Until the grimoire within you stirs,
and gives its power to Lord Maksis.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:11.640
That is the best way to safeguard
anyone from further injury.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:14.510
Come, discard that ring.

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.530
You can't go.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.200
Don't go!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:42.620
Rem? Why are you stopping me?
And those scratches...

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:47.880
Your father grieves, you know.
Next time he may tear you limb from limb.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:52.090
I never thought you'd start
working for Maksis again.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:55.180
What of your obligation to the
Arlond family for taking you in?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.470
Obligation?

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:04.690
Such a lovely word should never
pass the lips of the Arlond heir.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:08.480
And a mere watchdog
should never order me around!

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.240
Let her go!

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:20.290
Shall I dig her heart out right here and now?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:30.670
You are the grimoire's precious vessel.

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:33.800
I won't hand you over to anyone.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:40.060
No... don't!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.320
Lindo!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.860
Ritsuka!

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:58.660
Are you all right, Ritsuka?

00:16:58.660 --> 00:16:59.660
Blood...

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.750
Why, you...

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.630
No!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:10.840
Lindo! Rem--

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:14.420
You get away from her!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.850
Big... brother?

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:34.950
Ritsuka!

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:42.830
No!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.460
Lindo?

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:12.730
Would you destroy Ritsuka, too?!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.410
Lindo?!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:26.080
I... I--

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:30.830
Lindo! It's okay! It's going to be okay!

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:45.770
Rem...

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:54.520
Come, we'll open it together this time for sure:

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.900
the door that leads to Lord Maksis...

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.700
An unknown world awaits you.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:04.990
I won't give up. All for Lord Maksis...

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:16.840
Thanks.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:23.640
I'm sorry, Ritsuka. I--

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:28.390
Did you know that I was the grimoire?

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.480
Please--no more lies.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:35.400
Yes. Grandfather told me.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.650
I knew it. And Mom, too?

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:42.990
You know the potpourri
in that pendant she gave you?

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:49.410
That was special, holy potpourri Mom had grown.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:54.250
It masked the scent of the grimoire completely.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.630
Then how...

00:19:56.630 --> 00:20:00.630
One year ago, when you learned
that Grandfather had died,

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:04.510
your keyed-up emotions meant
the grimoire gave off a scent

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.560
that even the potpourri couldn't hide.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:12.520
It was for only a moment,
but long enough for them to notice.

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:16.190
And within the year, they had come for us.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:20.610
So Mom's kidnapping was my fault.

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:21.530
No, it wasn't!

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:23.660
It <i>was</i>!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:27.630
Ritsuka! All Mom and I
want to do is protect you!

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:33.080
Don't bother. I want all this to be over.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.840
I hand over my power and
that's the end of it, right? So--

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:38.710
You can't!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:39.840
Why not?

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.010
Because...

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:47.390
Because it would mean the end of <i>you</i>.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:53.770
That's all I can say for now... but trust me.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:58.610
I'm determined to keep you safe,
even if it costs me my life!

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:08.070
Everyone's hiding something.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:11.540
My brother was like someone else entirely.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:18.960
Who should I trust?
What's the truth, and what's a lie?

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.880
What should I do?

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.850
Checkmate.

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:40.900
You can't go!

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.200
I...

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:59.500
<i>It's a secret you can't tell anyone</i>

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:10.010
<i>Wonth gir sliv edhti wecnad</i>

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:11.470
<i>Wonth gir</i>

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:17.100
<i>Cracking a smile only at the witching hour</i>

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:20.060
<i>Spreading rumors sotto voce</i>

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>You knocked on the door</i>

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:26.110
<i>Without looking behind you</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:29.780
<i>With all these mysteries, impossible to solve</i>

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:32.700
<i>You stopped cold, weak in the knees</i>

00:22:32.700 --> 00:22:35.200
<i>It hacks everything</i>

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:37.500
<i>The curse of love</i>

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:39.750
<i>The curse--and you</i>

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>If you're confused about the touch on your skin</i>

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:47.800
<i>We just can't be transparent</i>

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:51.680
<i>Soon (soon)</i>

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:54.350
<i>Won't you take this hand?</i>

00:22:54.350 --> 00:23:02.060
<i>Mademoiselle, mademoiselle:
I'll make you happy</i>

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:05.860
<i>This night will never come again</i>

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:08.740
<i>So let us swear to one another</i>

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:16.080
<i>The black clown singing of love
at the tip of the moon</i>

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.830
<i>Obscuring the sky</i>

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:22.790
<i>Casting a spell with a bewitching fever</i>

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:41.060
"Waltz of Transience"

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:39.020
Waltz of Transience.
